-- **Submit review** ends the stage. With items declined Shaky or to be redone, it starts Claude's next steps for them (accepted items carry over), and the next stage comes back to you. With every item accepted or rejected it leads to the **end confirmation** (no Claude step). Submit seals the session's Undo (10.14).
